WEBVTT

00:00:00.550 --> 00:00:06.737
Here's how contest-day tracking works. We'll follow one guard, Edgewood, from check-in to loaded out.

00:00:06.937 --> 00:00:12.090
Every station taps its own step. Everyone else sees it a few seconds later.

00:00:12.940 --> 00:00:20.740
Eight thirty-five. Edgewood's bus pulls up. The check-in desk taps Unit check-in and gives them a home room: Hall 4.

00:00:21.590 --> 00:00:29.000
Meanwhile their props and tarp come in the prop door. The unload crew taps Edgewood, and it greys out with the time.

00:00:29.850 --> 00:00:37.616
A guide picks up Edgewood. From now on, their screen is all about this one guard: the home room, the warm-up area, and what's next.

00:00:37.816 --> 00:00:43.120
The big button is the next step. Take them to the home room, tap, and so on.

00:00:43.970 --> 00:00:53.430
At eight forty-six they head to warm-up and drop their equipment at inspection. The guide taps it, and on the inspectors' screen, Edgewood lights up.

00:00:54.280 --> 00:01:03.411
The inspectors finish, and the guide sees it. Physical warm-up, then they pick up their equipment for visual. The prop crew stages the props at warm-up.

00:01:03.611 --> 00:01:09.340
Next for the guide: transit to performance, with the scheduled time right on the button.

00:01:10.190 --> 00:01:20.452
Guard and props meet up and head to the gym. The performance door taps On floor, and the H Q board shows Edgewood performing, with the next guards on deck and in the hole.

00:01:20.652 --> 00:01:28.390
H Q also sees every home room, and below, every guard: where it is, how long ago, and anything running late.

00:01:29.240 --> 00:01:37.210
After tarp folding, the guide taps Transit back to H R. That same tap lights Edgewood up on the loading crew's screen.

00:01:38.060 --> 00:01:45.200
The props are loaded and gone, and the guide clears the home room. Hall 4 is free again for a later guard.

00:01:46.050 --> 00:01:52.237
That's the whole day. Every station taps its own step, nothing is ever blocked, and H Q sees it all.

00:01:52.437 --> 00:01:55.840
Each station has its own short video next.
